?�\u0001���������O����f�?��R([�u�F�����\u0018��?��\u001b��7��x\u000b�VS6�ܭ\u0014_\u0003�����͖�7e���*Ԑ\\�����ۏ�ao\u0006����퇿n�~���￲��]��ns�\u001e�R����z��aj\u0017�����[46�ϓ��z�\n?�\u000bs�6b�&��X���\u0011c�-\u0019��m�K��������W\u001c��A��[ʵ�-�|3.����Y\u0017n!\u0018S!X{�%Y��`�-#V����Vr�~�#�n�֘\u001157�kE����b|\u0006�j�\u0015g�\r�tEob-h��QX3�\u000b��}\u00175[��Þ��\u001c��^��7���?���mﲟ~�n7�/?�qr>�▼ſ��|�v7\u0007��b7�\u0010#0̆W\u0014p�歯#Vo�Xo\u0007y\u001foə�ћoֱ;��\u000b�\u0016\u0012��7�ٟ�\u0001�\u001d��\u0006\u0002\u000f�M�\f\u0006�[%��\u0001�\u0017]\u0006࣭�U\n\n...374697 bytes truncated...\n\nThe tool call succeeded but the output was truncated. Full output saved to: /home/hal/.local/share/opencode/tool-output/tool_15698b6c8001QbIV7cAlrVm1tg\nUse Grep to search the full content or Read with offset/limit to view specific sections."
